  title="Interview Bank — Questions 9–16"
  notes="Q9: Bad liveness kills pod; bad readiness removes from Service only. Q10: nslookup from debug pod in same namespace isolates DNS. Q11: ConfigMap mount may be stale (subPath) or app can't parse — logs --previous. Q12: AvailableReplicas < Desired — not enough Ready pods. Q13: PVC Pending — no matching PV, wrong storageClass, quota. Q14: MultiAttach — RWO still attached on another node. Q15: Node NotReady — pods may continue temporarily; scheduling/lifecycle impaired. Q16: Evicted — node pressure (memory/disk/PID). Structure answers: symptom → signal → command → root cause → prevention."
